{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_chat_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "03014013cc5ac5b6a29775558425e00dfea370826e26c408374616759c2a2666", "ja": "この間、音無先輩と一緒に\n資料作りをしたけど……\nすごかったな～。", "zh": "前段时间，我和音无前辈一起做了资料……\n真厉害啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_chat_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "12ce07d125ddb4ebaedb620d29dd96e05aefc651dc5658b1a7e5483c2bf2be16", "ja": "コピーをとるのも早くて、\nホッチキスで止める速度も\nあっという間で……！", "zh": "复印的速度很快，\n连用订书机装订也一眨眼就完成了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_chat_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "de01de9cfa2b8109fdbf33b7a6fbe4fcdc52a95347037694aac7f3e262d9e510", "ja": "おまけにミスも一切なし。\n見ていて惚れ惚れする\nくらいだったな～……。", "zh": "而且完全没有出错。\n看得我都不禁为之着迷了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_chat_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "f6891af814fdd0c1fbc904bb973491f9322463dd5ef9f4e3cbe66ca31f2f6484", "ja": "私は後輩だけど……\n同じ事務員なんだもの、\n負けてられないよね……！", "zh": "虽然我是后辈……\n但我们都是事务员，不能输给她呢……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
